<title>USA: Fed says overnight system repo totaled $4.440 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed says overnight system repo totaled $4.440 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve added a total of $4.440 billion in temporary reserves to the banking system during a round of overnight system repurchase agreements on Monday, a Fed spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1676 ))</p>
